msgstr "火山岩に含まれる鉱物。暗い緑色をしている"

msgid "Gold Gear"
msgstr "金の歯車"

msgid "A precise gear made of pure gold, exceedingly valuable."
msgstr "純金で作られた精密な歯車。非常に高価"

msgid "Iron"
msgstr "鉄"

msgid "A metal easy to work, forming the core of industry."
msgstr "加工しやすく産業の中核をなす金属"

