msgstr "未加工の鉄鉱石。製錬すれば鉄になる"

msgid "Silver Shard"
msgstr "銀の欠片"

msgid "A faintly glowing sliver of silver, said to ward off the unclean."
msgstr "淡く光る銀色の金属片。不浄なものを退ける力があるとされる"

msgid "Rusted Chain"
msgstr "錆びた鎖"

msgid "A piece of old chain that once held something bound."
msgstr "古い鎖の一部。何かを繋ぎ止めていた痕跡がある"

msgid "Meteoric Iron"
msgstr "隕鉄"

