msgstr "銅色の電線。導電性に優れる"

msgid "Mist Crystal"
msgstr "霧の結晶"

msgid "A strange substance like crystallized mist, cold to the touch."
msgstr "霧が結晶化したような不思議な物質。触れると冷たい"

msgid "Blue Crystal"
msgstr "青水晶"

msgid "A clear blue crystal that radiates a chill."
msgstr "澄んだ青色の水晶。冷気を感じる"

