msgstr "漆黒に輝く火山ガラス。鋭い刃を作るのに適している"

msgid "Black Pearl"
msgstr "黒真珠"

msgid "A jet-black pearl from the deep sea, exceedingly rare."
msgstr "深海から取れる漆黒の真珠。極めて稀少"

msgid "Black Powder"
msgstr "黒色火薬"

msgid "A dangerous powder used as the raw material for explosives."
msgstr "爆発物の原料になる危険な粉末"

msgid "Shelter Notice"
msgstr "避難所の張り紙"

msgid "\"Third Shelter is full. Head to the school in the west.\" The ink has bled, and the date is no longer legible."
msgstr "「第三避難所は満員。西の学校へ向かえ」インクは滲み、日付はもう読めない。"

msgid "Scribbled Note"
msgstr "落書きのメモ"

msgid "Graffiti peeled from a wall. \"Water at the southern supply point. Don't move at night.\" Written in a child's hand."
msgstr "壁からはがした落書き。「水は南の給水所。夜は動くな」子どもの字だ。"

msgid "Handwritten Receipt"
msgstr "手書きのレシート"

msgid "A faded receipt. Two cup noodles, four bottles of water, packing tape. Dated three days before the disaster."
msgstr "色褪せたレシート。カップ麺2・水4本・ガムテープ。日付は災害の三日前。"

msgid "Diary Scrap"
msgstr "日記の切れ端"

msgid "\"No one came again today. Five days of supplies left.\" The rest is torn away and unreadable."
msgstr "「今日も誰も来なかった。備蓄はあと五日分」続きは破れて読めない。"

msgid "Message to Family"
msgstr "家族への伝言"

msgid "\"Heading north ahead of you. If you survive, meet at Grandma's house. —Dad.\" Four pushpin marks remain."
msgstr "「先に北へ行く。生きてたら祖母の家で。—父」画鋲の跡が四つ残る。"

msgid "Job Posting"
msgstr "求人の貼り紙"

msgid "\"Demolition workers urgently wanted, daily pay negotiable.\" The phone number is blacked out."
msgstr "「解体作業員 急募 日給応相談」電話番号は塗り潰されている。"

msgid "Roadblock Notice"
msgstr "通行止めの告知"

msgid "\"Road closed ahead due to collapse. —City.\" It was tied to a rusted barricade."
msgstr "「この先 崩落につき通行止め 市」錆びたバリケードに括られていた。"

msgid "Someone's Scrawl"
msgstr "誰かの走り書き"

msgid "A note in the corner. \"Don't trust him. Hide your supplies yourself.\" Pressed hard into the page."
msgstr "隅にメモ。「あいつを信じるな。物資は自分で隠せ」筆圧が強い。"

